-- The garden platform (the book's map of Noke's Tower, the round platform with the trees), redrawn in our
-- pieces, about ten feet up. The ramp from the lawn comes up in the south; the hall's locked door is at
-- the north-west, where the bridge to the hall starts. Everything past the branches is a drop.

